{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52803","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 陆善经","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至贵不忘初，辞荣返旧居。\n霓裳因宠锡，鹤驾欲淩虚。\n丹禁倾三事，青门祖二疏。\n函关遇真隐，应演道家书。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆善经","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}